From: hawkff <109485367+hawkff@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 14:46:38 +0000
Subject: Do not reuse a custom tab across profiles

When an app opens a link with the session of a custom tab or trusted
web activity that is already open, the link loads in that activity's
tab, whose profile was chosen when the activity was created. After the
option to open links from other apps in incognito was turned on, such a
link from the same app loaded in the regular profile of the older
activity; after the option was turned off, it loaded in the older
activity's off-the-record profile.

Now a link whose new custom tab would be off the record while the open
tab is not, or the other way around, opens in a new custom tab, which
uses the profile the link asks for. A link that matches the open tab's
profile still loads in it.

